# Allowlist. The repository-root build context holds only what the Python
# images COPY: the lockfile, the gateway package and the example tenant
# documents and backends. Docs, tests, coverage and mutation output stay on the
# host, so they cannot leak into an image or slow the context transfer.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!app/
!examples/

# Never send these, even from allowlisted directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.run
examples/edge/certs
examples/apim-security/.runtime
examples/azure-validation/.runtime
**/.env
**/.env.*
